  "terrainName": "bt-range",
  "description": "BC-5 (CE-2261): the six-man squad (Veteran) clears the CQB test house on bt-range from its front door. An insurgent stands at the east end of the hallway, facing the front door: the stack comes under fire at the way in, so nobody goes through the doorway — the first two fight from pie points beside it, leaning round the jamb (frame posts) — and only after 3 s of quiet does the entry go in. A man shot before the entry is replaced from the stack. A second insurgent holds room A. Ends with both insurgents down and every room cleared once. ⚠ No grenades: the bang-out (BC-4) waits on backend's thrown-grenade fix (NOTE_Behaviors_To_Backend_Thrown_Grenades_At_A_Doorway). Check: the twin ClearingScenarioTests.CE2261_*."
 },
